    <tags>toranja overlay chat streaming twitch youtube obs social-stream-ninja transparent click-through tauri</tags>
    <summary>Lightweight transparent click-through chat overlay for single-monitor Windows streamers.</summary>
    <description>Toranja Overlay is a free, open-source, 100% local Windows desktop application built with Tauri 2 + Rust to display your Social Stream Ninja chat directly over games on a single monitor.

### Key Features

- **True Mirror Transparency:** Automatically strips solid backgrounds (such as `dock.html`) with the **Fundo transparente** toggle and live opacity slider (`20%` - `100%`).
- **Click-Through and Always-on-Top:** Keep chat floating over games while mouse clicks pass right through to the game window.
- **Frameless Transparent Edit Frame:** Reposition and resize from all 8 edges/corners without breaking Windows DWM transparency (`Fixar` or `Esc`).
- **Global Recovery Shortcuts:** `Ctrl + Shift + Alt + X` (toggle edit/pinned mode) and `Ctrl + Shift + Alt + H` (show/hide overlay).
- **OBS Studio and Windows Automation:** Detects running OBS Studio processes (`obs64.exe`, `obs32.exe`, `obs.exe`) and supports optional startup with Windows (`--background`).
- **Local Privacy:** No account, no login, no telemetry, and strict HTTPS origin isolation for `socialstream.ninja`.

### Requirements and Notes

- **OS:** Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit) with Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (installed automatically if missing on Windows 10).
- **UI Language:** Brazilian Portuguese (`pt-BR`).
- **Games Note:** Works best with games running in **Borderless Windowed** mode; Exclusive Fullscreen games control video output directly and do not guarantee third-party overlays.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/macielhenrique/toranja-overlay/releases/tag/v0.1.0</releaseNotes>
